Given `globalThis.fetch` default returns a real Response with both .json() and .text(). Test stubs: unknown. I'll support both, preferring `.text()` then fallback to `.json()`. Wait, if I call text() first on a real Response, that's fine. If stub only has json(), then text undefined → fallback.

```js
